			<div class="content" id="post-content-4675023">
									

<p>It's/was a Pattern Screamer, something that desperately wants to exist.</p>
<p>This Pattern Screamer is a thought form, an idea, if you will (Read the S&amp;C Plastics tales to get a better grasp of it), meaning it is what the majority of sapient beings think it is.<br />
Why a goat lady?<br />
Some hiker found something (completely unrelated since the scp didn't exist yet) in the woods, came home and spread the story.<br />
The Screamer, seeing the opportunity, leeched onto the story, becoming one with it.<br />
People went to investigate, found it, thus anchoring it to reality.</p>
<p>Enter Foundation.</p>
<p>The article specifies the &quot;Disinformation Campaign &quot;Goat Woman&quot; was mobilized and distributed to local media outlets while local law enforcement were issued an amnestic regimen.&quot; now this means that everyone either forgot about it, or thinks its a goat woman, thus, it is one.</p>
<p>The entirety of the containment procedures is about feeding that idea to people so it stays controlled.</p>
<p>The skip changed over time because stories are misinterpreted and/or retold differently over time.</p>

